"He was about five feet, six inches tall, and I would estimate him to be about 28 years old, although he could have been much older...His hair was sandy in color, and hung in beautiful waves to his shoulders, glistening more beautifully than any woman's I have ever seen. The beauty of his form surpassed anything I had ever seen. And the pleasantness of his face freed me of all thought of my personal self. I felt like a little child in the presence of one with great wisdom and much love, and I became very humble within myself...for from him was radiating a feeling of Infinite Understanding and Kindness, with Supreme Humility."

